1779
00:41:44,910 --> 00:41:46,180
<font size="64">Something you can't compromise on.</font>

1780
00:41:46,480 --> 00:41:47,980
<font size="64">- I... - For me,</font>

1781
00:41:47,980 --> 00:41:49,210
<font size="64">it's the sense of humor.</font>

1782
00:41:50,550 --> 00:41:52,010
<font size="64">- Se Chan... - That's important.</font>

1783
00:41:50,750 --> 00:41:53,750
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's nothing but humorous.)</font>

1784
00:41:52,010 --> 00:41:53,820
<font size="64">I want to live a fun life.</font>

1785
00:41:53,820 --> 00:41:56,350
<font size="64">- Se Chan is an expert. - He's good.</font>

1786
00:41:54,020 --> 00:41:56,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's a master of comedy.)</font>

1787
00:41:56,350 --> 00:41:58,790
<font size="64">- He can always wear wigs. - Nice.</font>

1788
00:41:59,050 --> 00:42:00,160
<font size="64">- Definitely. - He can...</font>

1789
00:41:59,220 --> 00:42:01,220
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(In a daze)</font>

1790
00:42:00,160 --> 00:42:01,260
<font size="64">- draw a beard on his face. - He...</font>

1791
00:42:01,260 --> 00:42:03,160
<font size="64">You can have breakfast with fake beards.</font>

1792
00:42:03,160 --> 00:42:04,190
<font size="64">- Right. - That would be amazing.</font>

1793
00:42:03,730 --> 00:42:05,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Imagining)</font>

1794
00:42:04,190 --> 00:42:06,500
<font size="64">- He hid his beard with makeup. - It's there.</font>

1795
00:42:06,600 --> 00:42:07,960
<font size="64">You two are a perfect match.</font>

1796
00:42:07,960 --> 00:42:10,170
<font size="64">Your baby would have beautiful eyes.</font>

1797
00:42:10,470 --> 00:42:11,970
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A gummy smile)</font>

1798
00:42:11,170 --> 00:42:13,170
<font size="64">- Already? - Se Chan...</font>

1799
00:42:13,170 --> 00:42:14,540
<font size="64">- Already? - I mean...</font>

1800
00:42:14,540 --> 00:42:15,640
<font size="64">Are you even thinking about their grandchildren?</font>

1801
00:42:15,640 --> 00:42:16,840
<font size="64">The baby can't have Se Chan's mouth.</font>

1802
00:42:16,840 --> 00:42:18,370
<font size="64">Even AI can't hide his face.</font>

1803
00:42:16,970 --> 00:42:20,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(No matter who he ends up with, his child will inherit his teeth.)</font>

1804
00:42:18,370 --> 00:42:19,380
