1805
00:42:19,380 --> 00:42:20,640
<font size="64">- The child would need braces. - Yura...</font>

1806
00:42:20,640 --> 00:42:22,310
<font size="64">could end up dating a guy...</font>

1807
00:42:21,640 --> 00:42:25,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's rooting for Se Chan and Yura.)</font>

1808
00:42:22,310 --> 00:42:24,750
<font size="64">- who's like a friend. - They'd be perfect too.</font>

1809
00:42:24,810 --> 00:42:27,720
<font size="64">This is hard for me.</font>

1810
00:42:25,350 --> 00:42:27,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Immersed)</font>

1811
00:42:27,720 --> 00:42:29,350
<font size="64">- Who are you to feel that way? - He...</font>

1812
00:42:29,350 --> 00:42:31,550
<font size="64">- Why are you so invested? - I'm putting myself in your shoes.</font>

1813
00:42:31,690 --> 00:42:35,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's obsessed with their love triangle.)</font>

1814
00:42:31,820 --> 00:42:33,120
<font size="64">Who should I pick?</font>

1815
00:42:33,120 --> 00:42:34,190
<font size="64">He's addicted to romance.</font>

1816
00:42:34,190 --> 00:42:35,660
<font size="64">Why are you putting yourself in his shoes?</font>

1817
00:42:35,660 --> 00:42:37,030
