1818
00:42:35,890 --> 00:42:38,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Who do you think are a better match for Se Chan?)</font>

1819
00:42:37,030 --> 00:42:38,160
<font size="64">- It's driving me crazy. - is a better match?</font>

1820
00:42:38,190 --> 00:42:40,260
