1823
00:42:42,460 --> 00:42:43,530
<font size="64">- Goodness. - Gosh!</font>

1824
00:42:43,530 --> 00:42:44,730
<font size="64">- I'll read the conversations... - This has happened before.</font>

1825
00:42:44,730 --> 00:42:45,870
<font size="64">Don't do that.</font>

1826
00:42:45,870 --> 00:42:46,940
<font size="64">I'll decide after seeing how it goes.</font>

1827
00:42:46,940 --> 00:42:48,140
<font size="64">He's done that to me before.</font>

1828
00:42:47,970 --> 00:42:52,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(While Se Chan is awkwardly caught between them,)</font>

1829
00:42:48,140 --> 00:42:49,370
<font size="64">- He's in 1,200 group chats. - He...</font>

1830
00:42:49,370 --> 00:42:50,710
<font size="64">Make up your mind today, Se Chan.</font>

1831
00:42:50,710 --> 00:42:51,810
<font size="64">I'm getting confused too.</font>

1832
00:42:51,810 --> 00:42:54,680
<font size="64">- It's a Korean set meal place. - There's a place like this here?</font>

1833
00:42:52,170 --> 00:42:54,540
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(they arrived at a Korean restaurant.)</font>

1834
00:42:54,680 --> 00:42:55,740
<font size="64">What is this?</font>

1835
00:42:56,310 --> 00:42:58,010
<font size="64">- What is this? - Amazing.</font>

1836
00:42:57,250 --> 00:42:59,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Plastic sheeting on the floor?)</font>

1837
00:42:58,010 --> 00:42:59,920
<font size="64">I'm seeing towels and all.</font>

1838
00:42:59,920 --> 00:43:01,750
<font size="64">I guess we'll get splashed with water.</font>

1839
00:43:02,250 --> 00:43:05,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Is the mission related to water as Detective Kook expected?)</font>

1840
00:43:02,550 --> 00:43:03,720
<font size="64">The plastic sheeting is making me nervous.</font>

1841
00:43:04,390 --> 00:43:05,590
<font size="64">I guess there's something with water here.</font>

1842
00:43:05,590 --> 00:43:08,960
<font size="64">We'll decide the team you'll do the second mission in.</font>

1843
00:43:06,420 --> 00:43:09,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Time to choose teams for the second time)</font>

1844
00:43:08,960 --> 00:43:10,860
