1847
00:43:12,030 --> 00:43:13,160
<font size="64">They would write names they didn't write before...</font>

1848
00:43:12,900 --> 00:43:15,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Feeling him out)</font>

1849
00:43:13,160 --> 00:43:14,300
<font size="64">- if they feel bad. - Alone?</font>

1850
00:43:14,400 --> 00:43:15,500
<font size="64">- Cho Rong. - Cho Rong.</font>

1851
00:43:15,500 --> 00:43:16,530
<font size="64">- Cho Rong. - Cho Rong.</font>

1852
00:43:16,430 --> 00:43:20,240
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They start trying to impress the two team leaders.)</font>

1853
00:43:16,530 --> 00:43:17,800
<font size="64">- If they feel bad... - Cho Rong.</font>

1854
00:43:17,800 --> 00:43:18,830
<font size="64">- Please. - Cho Rong.</font>

1855
00:43:18,830 --> 00:43:20,970
<font size="64">- I'm joining your team, Cho Rong. - Right.</font>

1856
00:43:20,970 --> 00:43:21,970
<font size="64">I'm joining your team, Cho Rong.</font>

1857
00:43:22,070 --> 00:43:23,340
<font size="64">- Yura. - Okay.</font>

1858
00:43:23,340 --> 00:43:24,970
