1873
00:43:48,500 --> 00:43:49,770
<font size="64">Yura, hey, come join us.</font>

1874
00:43:49,770 --> 00:43:51,970
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ominous)</font>

1875
00:43:49,770 --> 00:43:51,370
<font size="64">I don't think anyone wrote me down this time.</font>

1876
00:43:51,370 --> 00:43:53,800
<font size="64">- Team leaders, please step forward. - Let's do this.</font>

1877
00:43:53,900 --> 00:43:56,540
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's time for the members to choose.)</font>

1878
00:43:54,140 --> 00:43:55,970
<font size="64">- Let's go! - This is a tough choice.</font>

1879
00:43:55,970 --> 00:43:57,440
<font size="64">- This is a tough one. - Now...</font>

1880
00:43:57,040 --> 00:44:00,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Where does his heart lie?)</font>

1881
00:43:57,440 --> 00:43:59,070
<font size="64">- The choice is tough. - The others,</font>

1882
00:43:59,070 --> 00:44:00,810
