1883
00:44:00,810 --> 00:44:02,540
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Getting closer)</font>

1884
00:44:01,340 --> 00:44:02,980
<font size="64">- I can't believe them. - All right.</font>

1885
00:44:02,540 --> 00:44:06,020
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Did Se Chan choose Cho Rong again?)</font>

1886
00:44:02,980 --> 00:44:05,210
<font size="64">This time around, why don't I...</font>

1887
00:44:05,210 --> 00:44:06,220
