00:44:20,360 --> 00:44:22,330
<font size="64">- Why don't we... - She isn't looking at you.</font>

1899
00:44:20,860 --> 00:44:22,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Is she avoiding him?)</font>

1900
00:44:22,330 --> 00:44:23,900
<font size="64">She isn't looking at me. Darn.</font>

1901
00:44:24,300 --> 00:44:26,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Then...)</font>

1902
00:44:24,530 --> 00:44:25,870
<font size="64">Three should do.</font>

1903
00:44:25,870 --> 00:44:27,670
<font size="64">- This seems good enough. - Good.</font>

1904
00:44:27,670 --> 00:44:28,940
<font size="64">- Are you joining us? - Yes.</font>

1905
00:44:28,600 --> 00:44:31,240
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Se Chan switched from Cho Rong to Yura.)</font>

1906
00:44:28,940 --> 00:44:30,040
<font size="64">- Okay. - Let's do this.</font>

1907
00:44:30,040 --> 00:44:31,570
<font size="64">- Sure. - Have you all decided?</font>

1908
00:44:31,840 --> 00:44:32,980
<font size="64">- All right. - She wrote everyone but me.</font>

1909
00:44:32,040 --> 00:44:35,110
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Did Yura also choose Se Chan?)</font>

1910
00:44:32,980 --> 00:44:35,240
<font size="64">One, two, three.</font>

1911
00:44:35,380 --> 00:44:39,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok, Haha, Jong Kook)</font>

1912
00:44:39,150 --> 00:44:41,180
<font size="64">I have a feeling the two people I passed on...</font>

1913
00:44:39,850 --> 00:44:44,490
