1914
00:44:41,180 --> 00:44:43,050
<font size="64">will join me this round.</font>

1915
00:44:43,050 --> 00:44:44,090
<font size="64">Plus, I feel like Jae Seok...</font>

1916
00:44:44,550 --> 00:44:46,460
<font size="64">will join my team once more.</font>

1917
00:44:44,620 --> 00:44:46,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok, who is likely to choose her again)</font>

1918
