00:44:58,730 --> 00:45:03,870
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The members of Team Yura chose each other.)</font>

1925
00:44:59,440 --> 00:45:00,640
<font size="64">I knew this was the right call.</font>

1926
00:45:00,740 --> 00:45:02,570
<font size="64">- Done. - I knew it.</font>

1927
00:45:02,570 --> 00:45:03,910
<font size="64">- We got it right. - I got a feeling.</font>

1928
00:45:03,970 --> 00:45:05,810
<font size="64">She didn't write Se Chan's name.</font>

1929
00:45:04,540 --> 00:45:07,380
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Bitter)</font>

1930
00:45:07,180 --> 00:45:09,380
<font size="64">- Oh, no. - That's too bad.</font>

1931
00:45:07,640 --> 00:45:09,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sorry)</font>

1932
00:45:09,610 --> 00:45:11,480
<font size="64">- Se Chan was dumped. - Yura, that was amazing.</font>

1933
00:45:11,480 --> 00:45:13,220
<font size="64">- I mean... - Cho Rong kept avoiding my gaze.</font>

1934
00:45:13,520 --> 00:45:15,150
<font size="64">We'll move on to Team Cho Rong.</font>

1935
00:45:13,680 --> 00:45:16,890
