1936
00:45:15,280 --> 00:45:17,020
<font size="64">One, two, three.</font>

1937
00:45:17,020 --> 00:45:20,220
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ye Eun, Se Chan, Jong Kook)</font>

1938
00:45:20,060 --> 00:45:23,090
<font size="64">I wrote down Ye Eun's name because I wanted to team up with her.</font>

1939
00:45:20,220 --> 00:45:23,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Simple)</font>

1940
00:45:23,090 --> 00:45:26,130
<font size="64">As for Se Chan, I just keep wanting him on my team.</font>

1941
00:45:26,400 --> 00:45:28,760
<font size="64">I have a feeling things will get physical this round,</font>

1942
00:45:26,430 --> 00:45:31,700
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She chose Jong Kook using the same strategy as Yura.)</font>

1943
00:45:28,760 --> 00:45:31,300
<font size="64">which is why I picked Jong Kook.</font>

1944
00:45:31,830 --> 00:45:33,240
