<font size="64">One of you has to pay with your personal card.</font>

3908
01:31:50,080 --> 01:31:52,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(After splurging, they are asked to give their personal card.)</font>

3909
01:31:52,450 --> 01:31:53,650
<font size="64">- What did you say? - What?</font>

3910
01:31:53,650 --> 01:31:54,780
<font size="64">I'm dizzy. My blood pressure is shooting right up.</font>

3911
01:31:53,980 --> 01:31:55,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Rising blood pressure)</font>

3912
01:31:54,780 --> 01:31:55,880
<font size="64">What?</font>

3913
01:31:55,880 --> 01:31:59,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A survival battle of hyenas trying to bleed everyone else dry)</font>

3914
01:31:55,880 --> 01:31:57,120
<font size="64">- What? - I'm doomed.</font>

3915
01:31:57,120 --> 01:31:58,520
<font size="64">- Did you see mine? - No.</font>

3916
01:31:58,520 --> 01:31:59,920
<font size="64">- Don't lie to me. - I didn't see it.</font>

3917
01:31:59,520 --> 01:32:00,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Evil)</font>

3918
01:31:59,920 --> 01:32:00,990
<font size="64">This is so cruel.</font>

3919
01:32:00,950 --> 01:32:02,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Someone survives.)</font>

3920
01:32:00,990 --> 01:32:02,560
<font size="64">- Go. - Pick one.</font>

3921
01:32:02,490 --> 01:32:03,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(And someone is cleaned out.)</font>

3922
01:32:02,560 --> 01:32:04,060
<font size="64">- Yes! - Yes!</font>

3923
01:32:04,060 --> 01:32:05,590
<font size="64">They have no intention of giving it.</font>

3924
01:32:04,160 --> 01:32:06,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The final journey to defy a penniless destiny begins!)</font>

3925
01:32:05,590 --> 01:32:06,990
<font size="64">She's rummaging through everything.</font>

3926
01:32:06,360 --> 01:32:10,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The final journey to defy a penniless destiny begins!)</font>

3927
01:32:06,990 --> 01:32:08,590
<font size="64">- Did you find mine? - Here, and where?</font>

3928
01:32:08,590 --> 01:32:11,160
<font size="64">- Is this right? - Where on earth is it?</font>

3929
01:32:11,300 --> 01:32:13,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Where Is the Corporate Card?)</font>

3930
01:32:13,870 --> 01:32:19,240
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Running Man)</font>
